        "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the Game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Enchanted Broom》is a magical and exploratory 3D platformer! Play as a cute little witch and embark on a wonderful journey to find magic crystals. Mount your broom and start your magical adventure!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop on your broom and dive into a spellbinding magical adventure! This 3D platformer is packed with wonder and exploration—play as an adorable little witch, leap and soar through bright, vivid worlds, scoop up scattered magical crystals, and bring back balance to the realm! Every jump feels light as air, every flight is full of charm, and chasing those glowing crystals? Total joy you won’t want to pause!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About DimSumForge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DimSumForge is a studio composed of a college student. We create games using creativity and the technical skills we’ve learned.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About the Game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《Enchanted Broom》is a magical and exploratory 3D platformer! Play as a cute little witch and embark on a wonderful journey to find magic crystals. Mount your broom and start your magical adventure!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop on your broom and dive into a spellbinding magical adventure! This 3D platformer is packed with wonder and exploration—play as an adorable little witch, leap and soar through bright, vivid worlds, scoop up scattered magical crystals, and bring back balance to the realm! Every jump feels light as air, every flight is full of charm, and chasing those glowing crystals? Total joy you won’t want to pause!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About DimSumForge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DimSumForge is a studio composed of a college student. We create games using creativity and the technical skills we’ve learned.</p>",
